hvpatch (0.2.1-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Robustness from a review of the whole code base: tenant-proof kernel
    log check, quarantine of failed or interrupted levels, restore by
    atomic replace, hook timeouts and permission checks, cluster-wide lock,
    delay and pin for the timer, effective version for scanners.

